$ cd $SANDBOX/sbx/a-empty-engine
$ node $REPO/harness/cli.mjs init
----
sketchbook init: choose a starting point and/or set the brand. Starters:
  --start blank             Teams designing every component from zero.
  --start foundations       Teams settling tokens before any component: foundations, their Storybook pages and Figma variables.
  --start from-codebase     Teams with a product: audit its CSS and propose foundations from the values it repeats; the library and kits stay as they are.
  --start import            Teams with tokens already (DTCG / Tokens Studio, CSS variables): import them; the library and kits stay.
  --start library+kits      Product teams that need screens fast: every component plus page templates.
  --start library           Teams that want a working library now and rebrand it later (default).
  --start pick              Teams that need a subset: the chosen components (--components a,b) and what they depend on.
Brand options (all optional; unset ones keep their value):
  --name     Brand or system name
  --primary  Primary color as #RRGGBB, or "neutral" for the shadcn default
  --font     Font family name (falls back to the system stack)
  --radius   sharp | soft | round | pill-heavy (sketchbook presets radius)
  --density  compact | comfortable | spacious
  --danger   Destructive color as #RRGGBB
  --design   Design-file adapter: figma | none
  --file     Figma file key (when design is figma)
  --prefix   Element and CSS prefix, e.g. acme (acme-button, --acme-*); rewrites sources (see sketchbook prefix)
Example: sketchbook init --start library --primary "#2563EB"
---- exit 0
